**e allowed (e.g. `rmsnorm_add`, `attn_out_gate_mul`, `gdn_conv_bf16`, `gdn_delta_rule_bf16`) because they are local to a block and have a single reference.

### 3.4 Model recipe (TOML)

A recipe is a declarative map from a model's config.json to the block library:

```toml
[recipe]
name = "Qwen3.5-32B-A4B"
family = "qwen3_5"
layer_types = ["linear_attention", "full_attention"]

[layer.pattern_by_layer]
# maps config.json layer_type → block pattern
linear_attention = ["gdn", "moe"]
full_attention   = ["attn", "moe"]

[layer.by_type]
# per-type config (norm eps, head_dim, num_heads, etc.)
linear_attention = { head_dim = 256, num_heads = 32, ... }
full_attention   = { head_dim = 128, num_heads = 8, ... }

[quant]
format = "NVFP4"
```

The plan compiler reads
